WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.972 --> 00:00:08.141
[music playing]

00:00:08.208 --> 00:00:09.075
So now, I'm running.

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:10.343
And I have no plan.

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:12.212
And no idea where I was heading.

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:13.947
[screaming]

00:00:14.013 --> 00:00:16.549
And my heart is literally
just pounding through my chest

00:00:16.616 --> 00:00:18.251
to the point where
I think I'm actually

00:00:18.318 --> 00:00:19.953
going to have a heart attack.

00:00:20.019 --> 00:00:22.822
I just kept repeating to myself
in my head I was like, I just--

00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:23.723
I just can't get caught.

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:24.491
I can't get caught.

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:25.525
Stop!

00:00:25.592 --> 00:00:26.526
Stop!

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:30.764
I've got into sort of
like this undergrowth.

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:33.233
And I was getting scratched
all over my face and my arms.

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:36.269
[heartbeat thumping]

00:00:36.336 --> 00:00:37.437
I've come out the other side.

00:00:37.504 --> 00:00:41.441
And you know, I'm like a yard.

00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:43.243
And I've seen a
hole in the fence.

00:00:47.013 --> 00:00:48.148
I'm halfway through this hole.

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:50.183
I think I'm going to make it.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:51.151
[gun cocking]

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:52.585
And then I hear this voice.

00:00:52.652 --> 00:00:53.720
Stop.

00:00:53.787 --> 00:00:54.721
Don't move.

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:58.725
And at that point,
I knew it was over.

00:01:01.828 --> 00:01:03.696
I knew if I'd done any
sort of sharp movements

00:01:03.763 --> 00:01:06.266
and that he's probably going
to pull the trigger, you know?

00:01:06.332 --> 00:01:07.834
And I'd be dead.

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:09.436
He then kicks me.

00:01:09.502 --> 00:01:11.905
And before I know it, there's
like three or four of them.

00:01:11.971 --> 00:01:13.606
They're all just
like kicking me.

00:01:13.673 --> 00:01:16.476
[grunting]

00:01:16.543 --> 00:01:19.412
[screaming]

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:24.250
They marched me
back to the vehicle.

00:01:24.317 --> 00:01:26.953
Then, I'm seeing O
just casually chatting

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:28.421
to this police officer.

00:01:28.488 --> 00:01:30.590
And I was just in
complete shock.

00:01:34.027 --> 00:01:36.296
He betrayed me
massively, like probably

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:37.831
the biggest betrayal
you could have

00:01:37.897 --> 00:01:39.165
in that-- in that business.

00:01:41.901 --> 00:01:42.735
I was just seething.

00:01:42.802 --> 00:01:44.471
I was fuming inside.

00:01:44.537 --> 00:01:46.206
I just wanted to
grab hold of him.

00:01:48.641 --> 00:01:51.211
But the future
wasn't in my hands.

00:01:51.277 --> 00:01:52.779
They give, you know,
life sentences,

00:01:52.846 --> 00:01:56.516
and you know, the death
sentence for drugs in Thailand.

00:01:56.583 --> 00:01:59.652
And I am like completely
[bleep] to be honest.

00:02:05.825 --> 00:02:07.827
So after that, I was
taken to a safe house.

00:02:14.267 --> 00:02:16.669
You know, my mind just
still going round and round

00:02:16.736 --> 00:02:18.137
and doing somersaults.

00:02:20.673 --> 00:02:23.576
I remember thinking I'd
come to Thailand, you

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:26.479
know, start a new life,
build the relationship back

00:02:26.546 --> 00:02:27.480
up with my dad.

00:02:27.547 --> 00:02:28.848
And here I was.

00:02:28.915 --> 00:02:31.184
My dad would find out the hard
way when any word got around

00:02:31.251 --> 00:02:34.220
about what had just happened.

00:02:34.287 --> 00:02:36.923
You know, I was just left
handcuffed to this bed.

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:39.359
And I was there all night.

00:02:39.425 --> 00:02:41.528
And my body was craving ice.

00:02:41.594 --> 00:02:44.497
I was going through like
cold turkey, basically.

00:02:44.564 --> 00:02:46.332
There's only one place
that I'll be going.

00:02:46.399 --> 00:02:49.369
They call it a Monkey House,
a hell hole, basically.

00:02:53.573 --> 00:02:56.609
[speaking thai]

00:02:56.676 --> 00:02:59.979
You know, they eventually
put me back in the truck.

00:03:00.046 --> 00:03:01.214
[speaking thai]

00:03:01.281 --> 00:03:04.817
And they drove me to
a prison in Bangkok.

00:03:04.884 --> 00:03:08.454
[dog barking]

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:11.724
I remember seeing like the wall.

00:03:11.791 --> 00:03:13.826
I just didn't know what
was on the other side.

00:03:13.893 --> 00:03:15.428
That was the scary bit.

00:03:15.495 --> 00:03:17.463
Are they going to
sort of target me?

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:19.666
Is anything can happen to me?

00:03:19.732 --> 00:03:24.003
This could be my future for,
you know, a very long time.

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:25.305
I didn't know how long.

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:40.520
[speaking thai]

00:03:42.622 --> 00:03:45.825
And they basically said
take all your clothes off.

00:03:45.892 --> 00:03:47.060
It felt awful.

00:03:47.126 --> 00:03:48.528
Your self-dignity is just gone.

00:03:55.602 --> 00:04:00.373
And they're sort of checking in
my mouth, in my genital area.

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:02.609
Just don't even feel like
you're a person anymore.

00:04:02.675 --> 00:04:03.743
You know?

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:05.345
You just feel like a bit
of meat that, you know,

00:04:05.411 --> 00:04:07.947
you're just being
treated that way.

00:04:08.014 --> 00:04:10.783
This place was just like,
you know, a living hell hole.

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:15.021
And this was now my new reality.

00:04:15.088 --> 00:04:18.124
The officer has taken
me to the cell block.

00:04:18.191 --> 00:04:20.126
Got all these prisoners,
you know, they're

00:04:20.193 --> 00:04:23.463
[speaking thai],,
which is like Thai

00:04:23.529 --> 00:04:27.100
for-- they say for foreigner.

00:04:27.166 --> 00:04:28.601
And I remember looking
over and seeing

00:04:28.668 --> 00:04:30.370
two Thai inmates in
front of this guard

00:04:30.436 --> 00:04:31.738
who was holding a stick.

00:04:31.804 --> 00:04:34.107
The next minute, and
he's just smashed it down

00:04:34.173 --> 00:04:35.908
on the fingertips of the inmate.

00:04:35.975 --> 00:04:37.744
He's going to
smash, smash, smash.

00:04:40.613 --> 00:04:42.849
No emotion at all.

00:04:42.915 --> 00:04:46.352
At that point, I thought
there's no way I want

00:04:46.419 --> 00:04:47.787
to be causing trouble in there.

00:04:47.854 --> 00:04:48.755
That's for sure.

00:04:56.663 --> 00:04:58.197
It was actually
dark at that point.

00:04:58.264 --> 00:05:01.034
So it's like, what now?

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:03.269
And then, one of the
guys, he was like, you.

00:05:03.336 --> 00:05:05.104
He's like, you sit here.

00:05:05.171 --> 00:05:07.674
[speaking thai]

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:09.175
It was just so crammed.

00:05:09.242 --> 00:05:11.744
And like, there was just
no space at all in there.

00:05:14.947 --> 00:05:18.584
I was sleeping on a hard cold
floor with a water bottle

00:05:18.651 --> 00:05:20.920
as-- as my pillow.

00:05:20.987 --> 00:05:22.889
It was just soul destroying.

00:05:22.955 --> 00:05:24.323
I felt really agitated.

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:26.592
I was getting the cold
sweats because my body

00:05:26.659 --> 00:05:29.162
was still craving ice.

00:05:29.228 --> 00:05:31.130
[moaning]

00:05:31.197 --> 00:05:32.899
Got this guy, at the
same point, shouting.

00:05:32.965 --> 00:05:36.035
And you know, he's having
some sort of nightmare.

00:05:36.102 --> 00:05:40.440
[shouting]

00:05:40.506 --> 00:05:42.909
That was the most
depressed and helpless

00:05:42.975 --> 00:05:46.679
that I've ever felt in my life,
to be honest, at that point.

00:05:46.746 --> 00:05:49.015
Everything that I'd heard
about what these Thai

00:05:49.082 --> 00:05:50.450
prisons were like, it was true.

00:05:50.516 --> 00:05:52.452
And it was happening, you
know, in front of my eyes.

00:05:52.518 --> 00:05:54.687
And it's like your
worst nightmare.

00:05:54.754 --> 00:05:58.224
[music playing]

